WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.300
Open Calculate checked baggage charges on United’s Newark–Athens itinerary.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.800
The first checked bag costs $90 and the second costs $120.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.000
Press Option–Shift–Space and ask whether to add a second bag.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.208
Beside estimates 14.5 kg from the packing list. One 23 kg checked bag is enough.
